* Documentation

The manual for Twist is not yet available.  For now, see the
information in this file and the man page (twist(1)).

* Mailing Lists

There are currently no mailing lists for Twist.  Please send bug
reports and suggestions to <chris@localhost>.

* Bug Reports

Please report bugs to <chris@localhost>.  Include the following
information in your bug report:

  - The version of Twist you are using
  - The operating system and version
  - The hardware architecture
  - A complete description of the problem
  - The exact steps to reproduce the problem

* Contributing

See the HACKING file for information on how to contribute to Twist.

* Building from Source

See the INSTALL file for detailed build and installation instructions.

In brief:

  ./bootstrap
  ./configure
  make
  make check
  make install

